WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.157
I think one of the ways to describe it
for both Doug and I is that we're hopeful

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:11.177
that future crews on Dragon vehicles
headed to NASA space stations

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:16.297
aren't cursing our names because we
accepted some feature that was complicated

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:17.857
and hard to train, and in the end,

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.257
hard to operate.

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:21.297
They're like, yeah, I can't understand.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:22.917
I don't even remember why that's so easy,

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.237
but it is so easy.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:26.037
And so that they forget about us,

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:29.100
because they don't have anything
to curse our names over.

